HST Office: no engine version in window and dialog titles.

The application display name (title of the Start Center and of dialogs without own title,
e.g. message boxes) was "%PRODUCTNAME %PRODUCTVERSION" = "HST Office 26.8" (engine
version). It is now the product name only, like the document windows ("... — HST Office
Writer"). %PRODUCTVERSION in UI texts (e.g. "HST Office 1.0 Document Recovery") is the HST
release major.minor from /VERSION (include/hst_version.h). utl::ConfigManager::
getProductVersion() stays the engine version (extension compatibility, help paths).
On X11/GTK the application name (hidden leader windows, desktop app name) came from
bootstraprc ProductKey "HST Office 26.8": the trailing engine version is dropped there too
(vcl/unx X11Helper; the installer still writes ProductKey unchanged).

License: modified upstream files keep their license (MPL-2.0).
Test: tests/runtime/check-window-title.py under Xvfb.
---
--- a/desktop/source/app/app.cxx
+++ b/desktop/source/app/app.cxx
@@ -164,6 +164,7 @@
 #endif
 
 #include <strings.hxx>
+#include <hst_version.h> // HST_VERSION_* (generated from /VERSION)
 
 using namespace ::com::sun::star::awt;
 using namespace ::com::sun::star::uno;
@@ -419,7 +420,10 @@
 {
     const static OUString sBuildId(utl::Bootstrap::getBuildIdData(u"development"_ustr)),
         sBrandName(utl::ConfigManager::getProductName()),
-        sVersion(utl::ConfigManager::getProductVersion()),
+        // HST Office: "%PRODUCTVERSION" in UI texts (dialog titles such as Document
+        // Recovery) is the HST release (major.minor from /VERSION), not the engine version;
+        // utl::ConfigManager::getProductVersion() stays the engine version (extensions, help).
+        sVersion(OUString::number(HST_VERSION_MAJOR) + "." + OUString::number(HST_VERSION_MINOR)),
         sAboutBoxVersion(utl::ConfigManager::getAboutBoxProductVersion()),
         sAboutBoxVersionSuffix(utl::ConfigManager::getAboutBoxProductVersionSuffix()),
         sExtension(utl::ConfigManager::getProductExtension());
@@ -1422,7 +1426,9 @@
     recordTime(startT, "SetSplashScreenProgress(30): time = ");
 
     // create title string
-    OUString aTitle(ReplaceStringHookProc(RID_APPTITLE));
+    // HST Office: window/dialog titles show the product name only, never the engine version
+    // (26.8); the HST release version is shown in About and "soffice --version".
+    OUString aTitle(utl::ConfigManager::getProductName());
 #ifdef DBG_UTIL
     //include buildid in non product builds
     aTitle += " [" + utl::Bootstrap::getBuildIdData(u"development"_ustr) + "]";
